#11600
"An Old Cellar"
"This room has a feeling of disuse about it, enforced by old kegs, barrels and
crates which litter the floor and stand in musty corners.  The walls are
slightly damp, and covered in a layer of mildew.  The floor is littered with
bones of rodents, trapped here over the years.  A trapdoor is embedded in the
ceiling, a rope hanging from a ring bolted to its scarred surface.
"
