#11601
"A Small Workshop"
"This workshop is filled with shelves, stacked high with mostly unknown items.
They seem to have been awaiting repair for some time, as evidenced by the
coating of dust on several of the upper shelves.  A large counter against the
south wall indicates that this room may double as both a storeroom and a
repair workshop.  Scattered on various work benches are tools of all
description and size, in a clutter so random it must be by design.
"
""
