#11602
"An Opulent Foyer"
"This room stands in stark contrast to the cellar beyond.  Great care seems to
have been taken in its crafting, and the walls and floor appear to shine in
the light given off by a chandelier hanging from the ornately patterned
ceiling.  The walls are of a creamy shade of marble, and the floor of dark
obsidian colored stone.  The walls are adorned with various masterpieces of
artwork, and the central walkway is covered with a thick, red carpet.  A
fountain stands here, its centrepiece a cloaked and masked woman.  To the
right of the entrance way is a chair behind a heavy oak desk.  An archway lies
to the north.
"
""
