#11605
"Kitchen"
"This kitchen looks to contain more cooking equipment than should be possible
for its size.  Walls are adorned with hanging pots, pans and saucepans, and
its work surfaces are covered with huge stacks of dishes and vegetables.
There are large cabinets which look to be used for the curing of meat, and the
storing of more crockery.  A stunning array of knives and cleavers is on one
shelf, and yet more bizarre instruments adorn a row of hooks beneath it.  A
huge fireplace sits against the northern wall, with a bubbling vat suspended
above it.
"
""
