#11606
"Altar to Ashallan"
"This small room is hidden within heavy black shrouds, which adorn the walls
and ceiling.  The floor is of the same obsidian-hued stone used elsewhere, but
appears yet darker.  The lack of colour in the room as a whole would almost
give the appearance of a void, if it were not for the altar against the
eastern wall.  A huge block, seamlessly jutting from the floor stands here,
with ornately carved masks adorning its sides.  Atop the altar are huge black-
iron candelabras with red candles, which are providing light for the room.  In
the center of the altar is a statue which appears to be made from pure
platinum.
"
""
