"altar"
"On the altar is a statue of Ashallan, goddess of thieves, stealth and
deception.  The statue is finely crafted from pure platinum, and shimmers in
the candlelight.  She has obsidian chips for eyes, which can be glimpsed
within her masked face, reflecting the flames light in a thousand directions.
One hand is raised aloft, and it clutches a shining dagger.
"
