#11607
"Lounge"
"This seating area appears to be for relaxing, full of only the most
comfortable chairs and sofas, stuffed with padding.  The walls are painted
with murals of all descriptions, topped with ornate scrollwork where the walls
meet the ceiling.  Swooping gold sconces light the room, set in small alcoves
at equidistant points on the walls where they illuminate various works of art
and riches beneath them.  On the eastern wall is a large bookshelf filled with
tomes of great worth and rarity.
"
