kinds.  Piles of crates and boxes can be seen stacked high into the air, their
contents unknown.  Two large paintings are set into the northern wall, their
presence dominating the room by their size and vibrancy.  A few chairs are
scattered here, but the main object of this room is certainly not comfort.
Next to the huge metal plate covering the exit is a red button.
"
